        inShort: ["**A very small Ankleshwar maker of drug intermediates and specialty chemicals**, trying to become a contract manufacturer for European agrochemical and pharma companies and Japanese electronics firms.", "**Good:** multi-step chemistry and margins of about 32% in FY26. **Bad:** revenue has sat at ₹90–120cr for four years, fell 42% in Q1 FY27, and the new contracts, customers and sizes are withheld.", "**Verdict: avoid.** The base business has stalled and the growth that is meant to replace it cannot be checked."],
